{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，據加州大學伯克利分校、伊利諾伊大學厄巴納-香檳分校（UIUC）及Anthropic研究人員的一項聯合研究，僅需污染AI模型預訓練階段0.1%的文本數據，就可能在模型中植入難以清除的後門。<strong>即使隨後使用完全乾淨的數據進行微調和強化學習，這些後門仍可能保留，並在特定條件下誘導AI智能體執行攻擊者指定的命令。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587780.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.379050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"e9e1955093106bfe8a9c2b4b457ddf39c330355a9ab6ee7c61845302447405d5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}